WEBVTT

00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,766
The Sea-to-Sky Corridor could become the next hot spot
海天走廊有望成为下一个热门目的地

00:00:02,766 --> 00:00:05,300
for young independent travelers from Asia
吸引亚洲年轻的自由行游客

00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09.966
after being showcased by Chinese entertainer and thrill-seeker Wang Yibo
这得益于中国艺人兼冒险爱好者王一博的推介

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.233
If all goes according to plan
如果一切按计划推进

00:00:12.366 --> 00:00:15.600
there may soon be more tourists from China visiting Squamish
斯阔米什或将迎来更多中国游客

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.266
following a promotion of the district by the uber-popular Wang Yibo
这要归功于超人气明星王一博对当地的宣传

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:25.133
Destination BC's China branch partnered with the outdoor documentary series
不列颠哥伦比亚省旅游局中国分部与这档户外纪录片展开合作

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:28.300
Exploring the Unknown with Wang Yibo, Season 2
节目是《探索新境·寻找王一博》第二季

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.133
to showcase Squamish to millions of Asian viewers
旨在向数百万亚洲观众展示斯阔米什

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.900
For those unfamiliar with Yibo
对于不熟悉王一博的人来说

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.800
he is a widely recognized celebrity in China
他是中国家喻户晓的明星

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.833
The 28-year-old is an actor and singer, dancer
这位28岁的艺人是一名演员和歌手

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.466
and professional motorcycle racer
同时也是舞者和职业摩托车赛车手

00:00:42.266 --> 00:00:45.133
He is also a former member of the boy band UNIQ
他还曾是男子组合UNIQ的成员

00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:48.300
Episodes three through six of the docuseries
这部纪录片的第三至第六集

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.533
were filmed in Squamish and featured Yibo taking on outdoor adventures
均在斯阔米什拍摄，记录了王一博挑战多项户外运动

00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:54.600
such as aided and French free climbing at Smoke Bluffs Park
例如在烟雾崖公园进行辅助攀登和法式自由攀登

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.866
deep-water soloing
以及深水单人攀岩

00:00:56.066 --> 00:00:57.200
stand-up paddleboarding
立式桨板

00:00:57.366 --> 00:00:59.100
disc golf and sea fishing
飞盘高尔夫和海钓

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.433
In August, there were social media posts
去年8月，社交媒体上曾出现一些帖子

00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:03.766
about suspected Yibo sightings around town
称有人疑似在镇上见到了王一博

00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:06.400
including at the Arc'teryx Climbing Academy
其中一个目击地点是始祖鸟攀岩学院

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:09.866
But the production team kept the summer visit officially under wraps
但制作团队一直没有正式公开这次夏季拍摄行程

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.166
until the series was released in the fall
直到该系列于秋季上线
